      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frozen descriptors and registered operation profiles.\nInt is signed 32-bit wrapping; Index is an exact coordinate.\nNumeric handlers own rounding, overflow, bits and casts.\ncheck/ and runtime/ share rules; target realizations preserve them.",
